---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="Pool Pump Not Working – Spring, TX Repair" description="Pool pump repair in Spring, TX. Diagnose motor, capacitor, seal, and impeller issues. Fast, reliable service.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Pump Not Working</h1><p>Restore circulation before water quality declines.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>Without a running pump the pool becomes stagnant within days. Common causes include failed capacitors, seized motors, worn seals, clogged impellers, or power issues.</p>
    <h2>What We Check</h2>
    <ul><li>Power supply and timer settings</li><li>Capacitor and motor condition</li><li>Shaft seal and bearings</li><li>Impeller and strainer basket</li><li>Valves and plumbing restrictions</li></ul>
    <p>Many repairs are completed on the first visit when parts are in stock. We quote before replacing anything.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Fix My Pump</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
